<item><title>Mauritius adopts disaster bill setting work rules for torrential rain</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-adopts-disaster-bill-setting-work-rules-for-467ee0/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-adopts-disaster-bill-setting-work-rules-for-467ee0/</guid><category>Mauritius</category><description>The law bars most employees from being required to work once meteorologists issue a torrential-rain warning and sets higher pay for emergency staff.</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:39:24 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-adopts-disaster-bill-setting-work-rules-for-467ee0/share.jpg" length="42998" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-adopts-disaster-bill-setting-work-rules-for-467ee0/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
